[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_ihlkw")
name = "GIGA"
text = "• Vocaloid Roots: He began uploading Vocaloid music to Niconico around 2009–2010 and broke through with hits like \"Gigantic O.T.N\" (2012) and \"Hibikase\" (2014), helping shape Vocaloid EDM. He frequently uses Kagamine Len and Kagamine Rin, alongside Hatsune Miku and GUMI.• REOL & Collaborations: He worked closely with singer-songwriter Reol and video creator Okiku, forming the musical unit REOL under Toy's Factory before disbanding in 2017. He has also had frequent creative partnerships with producers like Orebanana-P (\"Gigabanana\") and TeddyLoid.• Major Works: Beyond Vocaloid classics and Project SEKAI: Colorful Stage! tracks like \"Ready Steady\", \"Wah Wah World\", and \"Beyond the way\", he has composed and arranged major mainstream hits—including \"Odo\" and \"Show\" for Ado."
